# Brand Overview

Aura is not simply an application.

Aura is a premium digital product designed to become the most elegant way to interact with the modern home.

Every visual decision must communicate:

• Simplicity
• Intelligence
• Calm
• Confidence
• Premium Quality

Aura should never feel technical.

Aura should feel inevitable.

---

