---

# Brand Test

Every new screen should answer these questions

Does it feel calm?

Does it feel premium?

Does it reduce complexity?

Would Apple ship something with similar attention to detail?

Would the interface still look modern in five years?

If any answer is "No"

The screen should be redesigned.

---

# Internal Design Rule

If something can be removed...

Remove it.

If something can be simplified...

Simplify it.

If something can disappear completely...

That is the preferred solution.

---

